<Layout title="How VendBI onboarding is assessed" description="Discover a considered approach to VendBI: requirements, hardware compatibility, product evaluation and an agreed rollout. VBN participation is assessed separately."><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">FROM FIRST CONVERSATION TO A CONSIDERED ROLLOUT</p><h1>A clear path.<br/>At your pace.</h1><p>Begin with your business. Verify the fit. Agree the next step. The exact onboarding process and timing depend on your requirements.</p></div></section><section class="section pt-0"><div class="container timeline">{[['Discover','Share your fleet size, locations, current setup and the questions you want to answer.'],['Confirm compatibility','Review hardware models, connectivity, supported workflows and known restrictions.'],['Evaluate the platform','Request an approved product walkthrough and agree a suitable evaluation scope.'],['Agree onboarding','Confirm commercial terms, account setup, data handling, training and operational responsibilities.'],['Review & expand','Assess the initial rollout before expanding. VBN screen participation needs a separate eligibility and readiness review.']].map(([t,d],i)=><article><span>0{i+1}</span><div><h2>{t}</h2><p>{d}</p></div></article>)}</div></section><CTA/></Layout>
